{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>消費者外出用膳，當然注重食肆環境衛生。Threads今日（21日）流傳兩段影片，顯示本港連鎖快餐集團一間分店已經關門，卻驚現鼠蹤，片中可見，兩隻大老鼠在店內木製圍板爬來爬去，包括向上攀爬，牠們沿着邊緣四處走動，一度互相依偎，表現親暱，畫面令人咋舌。</p><p>帖主表示「鼠鼠共舞」、「冇諗過啱啱去完迪士尼，出到嚟都仲見到老鼠」，並指出事發分店位於土瓜灣九龍城道，呼籲市民「睇路」。</p><p>許多網民驚呼「好大隻，好恐怖」、「香港啲鼠患真係好X嚴重」、「全港都好多老鼠」、「香港多老鼠到癲」。</p><figure><img alt=\"老鼠向上攀爬。（Threads@tweetyfcy影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201004358477549568169823.jpeg/QMxpixpcuqDgyeZmrMHSUvvtxnk0DlM0mXVK3Jl1Stw\"/><figcaption>老鼠向上攀爬。（Threads@tweetyfcy影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"牠們沿着邊緣四處走動。（Threads@tweetyfcy影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201004404770082816095287.jpeg/-C94WpQW9Jaz01RQ3kAMMXWZbDlElc4ZxW-cfcVvnH0\"/><figcaption>牠們沿着邊緣四處走動。（Threads@tweetyfcy影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"牠們互相依偎，表現親暱。（Threads@tweetyfcy影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201004457190494208560321.jpeg/JW9MneYzxfEtyhE2K8Z0TIKU9nlDS3jI_bWvtv21r7Y\"/><figcaption>牠們互相依偎，表現親暱。（Threads@tweetyfcy影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"牠們互相依偎，表現親暱。（Threads@tweetyfcy影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201004540426457088483279.jpeg/B6rrqTyUI7pfKLDR6n2XbnuNfZgtLUxV5tNwRubTcEY\"/><figcaption>牠們互相依偎，表現親暱。（Threads@tweetyfcy影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T19:15:54.953975+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":374,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T18:53:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T21:11:53.354699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T19:09:22.043325+00:00","content_hash":"98aa03b0b1adee8e07e364aa634594c74cd30f0f0349c35261d45b410fb82c0d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}